@title Finished lesson card: one cross, one All lessons button, Restart, no second Close
@area Learn
# A short challenge lesson played to its end with Do it for me. The end card keeps the cross in the header and offers All lessons and Restart; it no longer repeats Close next to the cross.
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text hold in
wait 6
click_text "The motor will not hold in"
wait 40
key shift+l
wait 40
click_text "Do it for me"
wait 60
shot 01-end-card
check_layout
expect "Shown, not solved"
expect "All lessons"
expect_not "Back to Home"
click_text "All lessons"
wait 15
shot 02-all-lessons-from-end-card
expect "Topic"
key Escape
wait 6
click_text "Close" #1
wait 10
shot 03-card-closed
check_layout
expect_not "Shown, not solved"
